# GTIS ID Print Station has NO build-time settings and no built-in credential.
#
# Never put any token, password or key in a .env file: Vite compiles VITE_*
# values into the app, and release builds are public. Staff sign in with
# their own portal account; the old device token is retired.
#
# Runtime switches (set in the environment when starting the app, not here):
#   GTIS_IDPRINT_PORTAL=preportal   use https://preportal.gtis.edu.ph for testing
#   GTIS_IDPRINT_SAMPLE=1           sample data, nothing sent to the portal
